@page "/multicounter"

@* #81 — two interactive Counter instances on the same page. Each
   should maintain its own state and respond to its own click events. *@

<PageTitle>Multi-Counter</PageTitle>

<h1>Multi-Counter</h1>

<p>Two <code>&lt;Counter /&gt;</code> instances on one page. Click events on
one should not affect the other.</p>

<div style="display:flex; gap:2rem; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <section style="border:1px solid #cbd5f5; padding:1rem; border-radius:6px;">
        <h2>Counter A</h2>
        <Counter />
    </section>

    <section style="border:1px solid #cbd5f5; padding:1rem; border-radius:6px;">
        <h2>Counter B</h2>
        <Counter />
    </section>
</div>
